                    <p class="card-text text-muted">Learn HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to build modern websites for your CSO.</p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-success me-2">Beginner</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary">8 weeks</span>
                    </div>
